"Past the storm wall lies a tropical island nation of warlords under a figurehead king."
"Every hundred years its twenty-odd princes fight a succession battle to the death."
"Its capital is a rainbow city on a floating white disk; Tier 5s there are ordinary."
"Across the storm, mages scorn gold and pay only in faint green spirit stones."
"Dark mages who use corruption are hunted there without question by righteous bands."
